<title>USA: Continental files $250 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Continental files $250 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc filed Tuesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $250 million in pass through certificates.</p>
<p>The certificates will represent ownership in a trust consisting of equipment notes for leases used to finance or refinance a portion of equipment, including engines.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
